# Credentials. Never commit.
.env

# Contains full questions and answers — operational data, not source.
logs/

# data/chunks.json, data/vocab.yaml, data/embeddings.npz and
# data/commencement.yaml ARE committed here — deliberately, unlike the
# monorepo's own copies. This repo has no kg_build/ and cannot regenerate
# them; without a copy checked in, there is nothing for the Dockerfile to
# bake into the image and nothing for the app to serve (this is exactly the
# failure a hosting platform hits if they're missing: RuntimeError: search
# index missing at chunks.json). embeddings.npz in particular must be the
# EXACT one built alongside the committed chunks.json — app.py refuses to
# start if they disagree, or if embeddings.npz carries vectors from a
# different embedding model than DPDP_EMBED_PROVIDER/DPDP_EMBED_MODEL name.
#
# in the monorepo checkout, backend/logs is a directory JUNCTION (Windows)
# pointing at the real Compliance-Assistant-level logs/ — see the setup note
# in README.md. That one is fine to stay ignored: it's write-only runtime
# state, never a build input.
data/*.pdf
data/overrides.yaml
data/plain_language.json

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
